#------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
#  Name            : ebz_depDetails.scr
#  Description     : fetchs Term Deposit Details
#  Date            : 05-09-2023
#  Author          : Harrison Ruiru
#  Input           : NA
#  Output          : NA
#  Called Script   : NA
#  Menu Option     :  (API)
#  Srl. No         Date            Author               Description.
